            <div class="probate-intro">
        	<p class="probate-intro__lead">    
				<p>Creating a Will can be unsettling for many people, but it is essential in planning for the inevitable. 
                A Will is a legal document that outlines how you want your assets to be distributed after you pass away, 
                and it can also include instructions for other matters, such as the care of minor children.</p>
